&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xOGmbLtXGkoQ7kNvwEZpjJT&_nc_oc=AdkxC4HlDQr2QZ3T5Z242kowmpfWd9iBo30VCyTcPnFFApmmmaw7U_554vavF3Dp2PU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afyw_6wTsKTAT0J2pDs8XGNynOrd6FJwprg5_2MBAAiv_Q&oe=69AD793B"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "VideoThumbnailforAccelerate_temp_2.png", "id": "1657469835145238", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982492_1657469838478571_4205052966596679185_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=BzCy_0rlNnQQ7kNvwE2DYhd&_nc_oc=AdkvCBmTmhF7pLe15Q1OyZG5sTKY9GUtLAWvpWBFWTHcL8O_4X_i_nGs1eFRph3x9ko&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afz63kSfzGH_cZbVyDiRGzumnZ2qfwKG9GyF4r0WDcoUkA&oe=69AD6E92"}, "display_name": "Accelerate", "keywords": ["Accelerate", "Laboratory", "Fourplus", "CellTherapy", "Bioscience"], "long_description": "Accelerate is a virtual reality training program for GMP operators, designed around Cell & Gene Therapy Catapult\u2019s manufacturing centre in Stevenage, UK. Accelerate navigates trainees through an immersive GMP compliant manufacturing facility, with standardized, modular content spanning: Cleaning, Gowning, Compliance and Health & Safety. The interactive laboratory walkthroughs and simulations provides exposure to a real-life facility, without the risks associated with in-person training.  \n\nAccelerate gives learners the opportunity to experience industry-relevant settings, bioproduction laboratories and clean rooms. In addition, the spillage training applies context to cell and gene transplants within a healthcare facility.  \n\nRemove barriers to high-stakes training and increase workforce competency with Accelerate.  ", "short_description": "Accelerate is a virtual reality training program for GMP operators, designed around Cell & Gene Therapy Catapult\u2019s manufacturing centre in Stevenage, UK. Accelerate navigates trainees through an immersive GMP compliant manufacturing facility, 